 "summary": "Gateway profile for the Spirax Sarco RIM10: 49 Analog Inputs, all polled. It reads relay states, flow direction, resettable and non-resettable totalizers, temperatures, turbine frequency, velocity, volume, corrected volume, mass and energy flow, density, viscosity, pressure, 4-20 mA inputs/outputs and enthalpy, with min/max records.",
